#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:5 40e9c71cb41742f8b077f8dcb67c4da5
msgid "Swarming"
msgstr "集群飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:8 02ce662228cc4d15bf2c05379cb3ec65
msgid "Swarming/Formation-Flying Interface (Beta)"
msgstr "集群/编队飞行接口（测试版）"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:13 d94052af61cb41af8ed9f0e1807b89c6
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Mission Planner supports limited \"swarming\", or formation-flying with "
"multiple UAVs.  At the moment this is in an experimental beta "
"implementation, which is admittedly neither easy to use nor 100% reliable. "
"However, if you're interested in multiple-UAV coordination, this is a good "
"place to start."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 支持有限的「集群飞行」或多 UAV "
"编队飞行功能。目前该功能处于实验性测试版实现阶段，坦率地说，使用起来既不简单，也无法保证 100% 可靠。但如果您对多 UAV "
"协同控制感兴趣，这是一个很好的起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:19 67c58d29cb354ca89438a2ca850b5049
msgid ""
"More sophisticated swarming/multiple-UAV control is available in "
"QGroundControl and APM Planner 2.0, which are both built on a multiple-"
"vehicle architecture. But Mission Planner accomplishes this in a limited way"
" by simply opening multiple serial port MAVLink connections simultaneously "
"(see four-UAV USB hub above) and passing GPS position information from one "
"(\"leader\", flying in any mode, from manual to auto) to the other "
"(\"followers\", flying in Guided mode). The GPS position of the leader is "
"adjusted by a set offset and then sent to the followers as a series of "
"dynamic waypoints.  In this fashion the followers will follow the leader at "
"set X,Y and Z offset distances."
msgstr ""
"QGroundControl 和 APM Planner 2.0 均基于多飞行器架构，提供了更完善的集群/多 UAV 控制功能。而 Mission "
"Planner 则通过同时开启多个串口 MAVLink 连接（参见上方四 UAV USB "
"集线器），并将一架飞行器（「leader」，可飞行任意模式，从手动到自动均可）的 GPS 位置信息传递给其他飞行器（「followers」，以 "
"Guided 模式飞行），以有限方式实现集群控制。leader 的 GPS 位置经过偏移量调整后，作为一系列动态航点发送给 followers，使 "
"followers 以设定的 X、Y、Z 偏移距离跟随 leader 飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:30 031d672569e64de9b9ce63a4667541b9
msgid ""
"This interface can be entered by pressing Control-F in the Mission Planner. "
"That will bring up a pretty crowded box of buttons (see below), but the key "
"ones are marked below: identifying the serial port of the \"follower\" UAVs,"
" and the \"swarm\" button, which will bring up the second window, with a "
"grid showing the relative position offset of the other UAVs."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中按下 Ctrl-F "
"可进入该界面。这将弹出一个按钮较多的窗口（见下图），其中关键按钮已标注：用于识别「follower」UAV "
"的串口，以及「swarm」按钮——点击后将弹出第二个窗口，其中有一个网格显示其他 UAV 的相对位置偏移量。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:40 d9fe506a73e448dd8bfbb7c9b949f050
msgid "Mission Planner: Screen with SwarmButton"
msgstr "Mission Planner：带 Swarm 按钮的界面"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:42 7deef14e72554d44a13d3be83a901d97
msgid "**Setup Procedure:**"
msgstr "**设置步骤：**"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:44 c1347062cb0e476c8f35fd6345e8f535
msgid "Plug in one 3DR radio per vehicle"
msgstr "每架飞行器插入一个 3DR 数传模块"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:45 888d201e110f4802aa878b4926fe127d
msgid "Connect to the \"leader\" in the Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中连接到「leader」"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:46 a3249ad7c8b7404f97282c26b3ba8c21
msgid "Press Control-F and click \"swarm\""
msgstr "按 Ctrl-F，点击「swarm」"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:47 f7adaf1d829e498c926cd32e5c6456bc
msgid "Click \"set leader\""
msgstr "点击「set leader」"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:48 4ab416170cf14b1993d9614f2f2073dd
msgid ""
"Click \"Connect MAVs\" (\"MAV\" stands for \"micro air vehicle\"). Click it "
"once for each MAV. As each connects via MAVLink they will appear on the grid"
msgstr ""
"点击「Connect MAVs」（「MAV」代表「micro air vehicle」，即微型飞行器）。每架 MAV 点击一次。每当一架 MAV 通过 "
"MAVLink 连接后，将出现在网格中。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:51 02fa7a06ee19480d9be8d9c414f9df49
msgid ""
"Drag the MAV circles around the grid to set the desired offsets. The Mission"
" Planner assumes that \"up\" is North."
msgstr "在网格中拖动 MAV 圆圈以设置所需的偏移量。Mission Planner 默认「上方」为正北方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:53 09bf3a702e554e5196356b69dc4e81d3
msgid ""
"\"Start\" will start sending Guided Mode waypoints to all vehicles except "
"the leader."
msgstr "点击「Start」将开始向除 leader 以外的所有飞行器发送 Guided 模式航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:56 daa002b7809e45c9aaf66e1f0210125c
msgid ""
"Now, as you may have guessed, getting the starting position can be the "
"hardest. In the grid they are identified by the MAV number and COM port. "
"It's a good idea to tape that MAV number to the physical vehicles "
"themselves, so you can correspond the on-screen numbers and grid position "
"with the physical layout of the vehicles on the ground."
msgstr ""
"正如您可能已经猜到的，确定起始位置可能是最难的部分。在网格中，飞行器通过 MAV 编号和 COM 端口进行识别。建议将 MAV "
"编号贴在实体飞行器上，以便将屏幕上的编号和网格位置与地面飞行器的实际布局对应起来。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:62 6a233253f3a54d4e9e46f928090973df
msgid ""
"Currently the code does no path prediction etc. A good place to start is "
"with two quadcopters about 20 m apart to test, and work up from there."
msgstr "目前代码不进行路径预测等处理。建议从两架相距约 20 米的四旋翼飞机开始测试，然后逐步扩展。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:65 806a1e21ae074b4fb72b24ff0682883f
msgid "**First Flight:**"
msgstr "**首次飞行：**"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:67 b68639211d3c4d83a6e650f685e77b27
msgid ""
"Take off with the leader, sit at say 2-10 m high (loiter). The leader flight"
" mode doesn’t matter"
msgstr "起飞 leader，悬停在约 2–10 米高度（Loiter 模式）。leader 的飞行模式不限。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:69 bd9746d0062844ef867537e6455deeac
msgid ""
"Click start. This should make the follower take off in guided mode (it will "
"take 3-5 seconds to launch) and sit at the same altitude as the master "
"(assuming you haven't changed the altitude offsets)"
msgstr ""
"点击「Start」。这将使 follower 以 Guided 模式起飞（起飞需要 3–5 秒），并悬停在与 master "
"相同的高度（假设您未更改高度偏移量）。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:72 5ffa9e3482074e22b5609e2cffa4315d
msgid "Manually move the leaders, and the 2nd quad (follower) should follow."
msgstr "手动移动 leader，第 2 架四旋翼（follower）应随之跟随。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:73 da8111961ee04746acd647e96559e819
msgid ""
"When you're done, manually land the leader. Use the \"Land\" button to tell "
"the follower to land, too."
msgstr "完成后，手动降落 leader。使用「Land」按钮通知 follower 也降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:77 a660011ecf88437f8fe1c561122a9642
msgid "**Tips**"
msgstr "**提示**"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:80 5c24517b5ece4106889f38b5612c66fc
msgid ""
"Don't close the swarming screen, as it will stop the swarming. (Since we use"
" guided mode, if you do the quad will just sit at the last commanded "
"location.)"
msgstr "请勿关闭集群飞行界面，否则集群飞行将停止。（由于使用了 Guided 模式，若关闭，四旋翼将停留在最后一个指令位置。）"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:83 02660daaecd545eeab0e53b37c3e712b
msgid "The main map interface will show both quads."
msgstr "主地图界面将同时显示两架四旋翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:84 a473874ac327453e85e2a11b2abfc401
msgid ""
"If you drag the quad around the grid screen, while it's active. the quad "
"should actually move as well."
msgstr "在集群飞行激活期间，如果在网格界面中拖动四旋翼，实体四旋翼也会相应移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/swarming.rst:86 1c7590e7884a4e7b94f099dd059c8181
msgid ""
"Increase the position stream rate in the mp. config>planner>position. to say"
" 5, from the default of 3. to reduce the latency"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 配置中提高位置数据流速率：config > planner > position，建议从默认值 3 提高至 "
"5，以降低延迟。"
